\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {1.4}{\ignorespaces Our model controls prosody efficiently. Its generated PAFs are closer to the ground-truth rendition than is the manually modified output of the AFP, called \sc  {CrudeControl}.\relax }}{12}{figure.caption.16}\protected@file@percent }
